{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03036","headline":"和崔黄门寓直夜听蝉之作 · 张九龄","name":"和崔黄门寓直夜听蝉之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蝉嘶玉树枝，向夕惠风吹。\n幸入连宵听，应缘饮露知。\n思深秋欲近，声静夜相宜。\n不是黄金饰，清香徒尔爲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03036.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03036","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}